'''Aurora''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance==
Its blade has a silhouette of mountains underneath a green and blue aurora, hence the name. The guard and handle are solid black.

==Trivia ==
*It has a [[Aurora Gun (2019)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Aurora_Set Aurora Set].

